  "description": "A fully managed, cross-platform media engine for .NET 10: the libvlc binding underneath the CodeBrix media libraries (LibVLC, Media, MediaPlayer, VideoFrameSink, discoverers, equalizer, dialogs). Ported from LibVLCSharp 3.9.7 — the official .NET wrapper around VideoLAN's LibVLC library — with types retaining their CodeBrix.Platform.MediaPlayerCore namespaces for drop-in compatibility. Requires the native libvlc runtime to be installed or referenced via the official VideoLAN.LibVLC.* NuGet packages.",
